DONE 11611 part B (ps-owapi-b): 19 of the 25 row-less POST/PUTs in connectors, conversation-learning, courtesy-delete, craft-candidates, diary/read, dreamer, embedding-spaces/refused/clear and federation now declare typed OpenAPI bodies and answers.
11611 PARTLY: 10 owner route files + new connector_admission_routes/schema.rs + owner_rest_paths.rs (19 binds) + owner_routes.rs (7 mod lines) + connector_admission_host.rs + 3 oneiron files (JsonSchema derives); 19 routes bound, 6 skipped (FIX lines below).
Rows (bound, 16 post + 3 put):
POST /v1/owner/connectors/consent, /v1/owner/connectors/enabled, /v1/owner/connectors/qualify, /v1/owner/connectors/refresh, /v1/owner/connectors/register, /v1/owner/connectors/slate/accept, /v1/owner/connectors/subscriptions
PUT /v1/owner/conversation-learning, /v1/owner/conversation-learning/me, /v1/owner/conversation-learning/setup
POST /v1/owner/diary/read
POST /v1/owner/dreamer/maintenance/action-mode/apply, /v1/owner/dreamer/maintenance/revert, /v1/owner/dreamer/pause, /v1/owner/dreamer/resume, /v1/owner/dreamer/revert
POST /v1/owner/embedding-spaces/refused/clear
POST /v1/owner/federation/grant-travel, /v1/owner/federation/peer-confidence
Notes: pattern copied from POST /v1/owner/intents (commit 5a74253d52); docs only, no handler/serde/field changed; SlateDisposition, SlateDataClass, ConnectorQualificationKit, ConnectorKeyView, ConnectorSlateView, DataClass, ActionModeCeiling, TravelChoice and EmbeddingSpacesView already derived JsonSchema, so only 5 engine/server derives were needed (ToolClass, ConnectorToolGrant, ChannelMessageSubscription, DiaryEntry, DiaryReadOutcome); connector_admission_routes.rs is already past 800 lines (869), so its 9 schema fns went into the new child module connector_admission_routes/schema.rs per rule 6; every bind path copied exactly from its route file's router (.route under /v1/owner); PUT binds use "put"; hand diff ~402 lines net (447 added incl new child, 45 removed for derive/mod swaps), ~21 per route like part A's ~20, over the 350 cap because 19 routes bound.
Seams: new pub(crate) schema fns register_request_body_schema/registered_schema/accept_request_body_schema/admitted_slate_schema/qualify_request_body_schema/connector_key_schema/refresh_request_body_schema/refreshed_schema/enabled_request_body_schema (new connector_admission_routes/schema.rs), consent_request_body_schema/consented_schema (connector_consent_routes.rs), subscribe_request_body_schema/channel_subscription_schema (connector_subscription_routes.rs), set_learning_body_schema/learning_reply_schema/set_own_body_schema/own_reply_schema (conversation_learning_routes.rs), answer_setup_body_schema/setup_reply_schema (shared_training_setup_routes.rs), read_diary_body_schema/diary_read_outcome_schema (diary_routes.rs), revert_maintenance_body_schema/maintenance_revert_schema/apply_action_mode_body_schema/applied_maintenance_schema (dreamer_maintenance_routes.rs), revert_change_body_schema/change_reverted_schema/dreamer_pause_body_schema/dreamer_paused_schema (dreamer_routes.rs), clear_refused_body_schema/embedding_spaces_view_schema (embedding_space_routes.rs), set_peer_scale_body_schema/peer_scale_schema/set_grant_travel_body_schema/grant_travel_schema (peer_confidence_routes.rs); pub(super) mods for connector_consent, conversation_learning, dreamer_maintenance, dreamer, embedding_space, peer_confidence and shared_training_setup in api/owner_routes.rs plus pub(crate) mod schema in connector_admission_routes.rs; JsonSchema derive one-liners in connector_admission_host.rs (ToolClass), oneiron connector_key/lifecycle/tool_grant.rs (ConnectorToolGrant) and channel_subscription.rs (ChannelMessageSubscription), and oneiron memory/diary_read.rs (DiaryEntry, DiaryReadOutcome).
